# What never reaches the Cloud Build upload (06-CONTEXT D-08, D-11). Releases are built from `git archive` of a clean
# commit (06-07), so only committed files are candidates; this list is the second fence. The git-ignored deploy
# configuration and the release records never upload.
.gcloudignore
# Version control and local environments.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
test-results/
# Tests stay out of the image; it runs the app and its jobs only.
tests/
# Secrets and deploy records: the git-ignored configuration, any .env file and the release manifests.
deploy/
.env
.env.*
# The web stage installs and builds web/ itself from the lock (npm ci).
web/node_modules
web/dist
